                                                "sense_id": "a9f57fb9-a417-3ec9-9c75-0ce7a35be685",
                                                "text": "The probability is that any verse of this nature, in which the lines are worn smooth, is one which has been causing tutorial ears to tingle for a generation at least; and very probably it is known in a variety of forms."
